{
  "description": "Updates the member's e-mail address to the specified value, leaving phone and mailing address unchanged, and confirms the new e-mail is saved on the member record screen.\n\nRecorded from the goal: \"Sign on to Meridian Core, look up the member, open their contact details for update, change only the e-mail address to the given value while leaving the phone and mailing address exactly as they already appear on the form, save, and confirm the record shows the new e-mail.\"",
